OL,3,GNEWSAYellow fog warning for Northern
OL,4,AIreland
OL,5,
OL,6,FA yellow weather warning for fog has
OL,7,Fbeen issued for Northern Ireland on
OL,8,FSunday night, with visibility expected
OL,9,Fto fall below 100 metres in places.
OL,11,FThe warning runs from 22:00 GMT on
OL,12,FSunday until 10:00 on Monday, with
OL,13,Finland areas expected to be most
OL,14,Faffected.
OL,16,FFog will continue to develop overnight
OL,17,Fand into early Monday, becoming dense
OL,18,Fin places before gradually lifting and
OL,19,Fclearing during the morning.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
