OL,3,GNEWSAYellow fog warning for Northern
OL,4,AIreland
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the Republic of Ireland, Met Eireann
OL,7,Fhas issued a status yellow fog warning
OL,8,Ffor 12 counties from 21:00 (local time)
OL,9,Fon Sunday until 11:00 on Monday.
